んです…やらせて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレはやっぱり恐れ多くて難しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もがアニメも漫画も好きすぎて、挑戦したくてもいつも中々手を出せないのですが、蝶野雛ちゃんはファンの方に性格とかが似てるーって有難いことに多く言っていただけたので、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似てるか似てないかは分からないけど、楽しかったしちゃんと愛も込めたつもりですので、よいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202411/mobz1UX45.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまた。"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-keya-33623":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうもどうも〜!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46   二期生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮崎県出身   20歳の松田里奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーテンを使って自撮りをしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/868/ba8ac9f6bd7ba4422e7a963f80677.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょっこりっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/868/ba8ac9f6bd7ba4422e7a963f80677-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/868/ba8ac9f6bd7ba4422e7a963f80677-02.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}